# chatapi — application environment. Fill every value; this is the .env the chatapi pod mounts.
# Also mounts (shared k8s secrets): jwt-keys (private/public.pem), cc-license (license.txt), wildcard-tls
# Values REDACTED — keys show what this app requires; supply real values at deploy time.

